note a small app where the page and the server talk to each other
when someone visits the path home do
show a heading with the words Add two numbers end words
show a box called first
show a box called second
show a paragraph called answer with the words Type two numbers, then press the button. end words
show a button with the words Add them end words that asks the path add and shows the reply in the paragraph called answer
reply with the page
end when
when someone visits the path add do
let first be parsed number of the visitor sent first
let second be parsed number of the visitor sent second
if first has a value as x then
if second has a value as y then
reply with the words The sum is end words followed by x plus y
end if
end if
reply with the words Please type two whole numbers. end words
end when
start the server on port 8098
